---
import type { WorkItem } from '../../data/site';

interface Props {
  work: WorkItem;
}

const { work } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="aletheia-page">
  <a href="/works" class="back-link">返回作品集</a>

  <header class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">{work.subtitle}</p>
    <h1>{work.title}</h1>
    <p class="intro">{work.detail}</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="https://www.modelscope.cn/studios/coolife/aletheia2.0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="hero-link primary">立即体验</a>
      <a href={work.repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="hero-link secondary">查看仓库</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="pipeline">
    <div class="node">输入问题</div>
    <div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Direction</div>
    <div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node wide">多角度 Agent 并行分析</div>
    <div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Inspector</div>
    <div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="node">Judgment</div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <article class="panel neon">
      <h2>为什么它特别</h2>
      <p>这个项目不只是在做一个聊天界面，而是在尝试把“调查过程”结构化：先定方向，再多角度并发分析，再检查漏洞，最后综合研判。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="panel">
      <h2>能力设计</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>事实核查、时间线、利益相关者等多个角度并行工作。</li>
        <li>支持联网搜索与来源追溯，减少只靠模型直觉输出的风险。</li>
        <li>支持流式分析过程展示，强调可观察性与过程透明。</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="panel">
      <h2>技术栈</h2>
      <p>后端使用 Python + FastAPI 组织 Agent 协作与接口输出，前端使用 React + TypeScript 承担交互与结果呈现。</p>
      <div class="chips">
        {work.tags.map((tag) => <span>{tag}</span>)}
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="panel">
      <h2>想表达的能力</h2>
      <p>它体现的是系统设计能力: 把复杂问题拆成多个职责单元，再通过流程控制、数据回流与验证机制，把“大模型能力”组织成一个更可控的产品。</p>
      <div class="panel-actions">
        <a href="https://www.modelscope.cn/studios/coolife/aletheia2.0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">体验入口</a>
        <a href={work.repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">仓库代码</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</section>

<style>
  .aletheia-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 6.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    color: #eff6ff;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15), transparent 24%),
      radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.18), transparent 24%),
      #020617;
  }

  .back-link,
  .hero,
  .pipeline,
  .grid {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.78rem 1.05rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.22);
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(8, 47, 73, 0.2);
    color: rgba(186, 230, 253, 0.78);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    transition: transform 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease, color 0.22s ease, background 0.22s ease;
  }

  .back-link::before {
    content: '<-';
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    transform: translateX(-4px);
    color: #cffafe;
    border-color: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.4);
    background: rgba(8, 47, 73, 0.82);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #67e8f9;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 44rem;
    color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
  }

  .hero-link,
  .panel-actions a {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 0.84rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.22);
    color: #bae6fd;
    transition: transform 0.24s ease, border-color 0.24s ease, box-shadow 0.24s ease, background 0.24s ease, color 0.24s ease;
  }

  .hero-link::before,
  .panel-actions a::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(110deg, transparent 20%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18) 50%, transparent 80%);
    transform: translateX(-140%);
    transition: transform 0.45s ease;
  }

  .hero-link:hover::before,
  .panel-actions a:hover::before {
    transform: translateX(140%);
  }

  .hero-link:hover,
  .panel-actions a:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.48);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.14);
    color: #ecfeff;
  }

  .hero-link.primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.18), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18));
  }

  .hero-link.secondary {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
  }

  .pipeline {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .node,
  .panel {
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.18);
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.06);
  }

  .node {
    padding: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.24s ease, border-color 0.24s ease, box-shadow 0.24s ease, background 0.24s ease;
  }

  .wide {
    grid-column: span 1;
  }

  .arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.86);
    transition: transform 0.24s ease, color 0.24s ease;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .panel {
    padding: 1.4rem;
    transition: transform 0.24s ease, border-color 0.24s ease, box-shadow 0.24s ease, background 0.24s ease;
  }

  .panel h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    color: #67e8f9;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .panel p,
  .panel li {
    color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .panel ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .neon {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(8, 47, 73, 0.96), rgba(76, 29, 149, 0.72));
  }

  .chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .chips span,
  .panel a {
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.2);
  }

  .chips span {
    padding: 0.48rem 0.72rem;
    color: rgba(186, 230, 253, 0.88);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    transition: transform 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease, background 0.22s ease, color 0.22s ease;
  }

  .panel-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .node:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.42);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(8, 47, 73, 0.28);
    background: rgba(10, 18, 34, 0.92);
  }

  .node:hover + .arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    color: #a5f3fc;
  }

  .panel:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.32);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(8, 47, 73, 0.3);
  }

  .chips span:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.38);
    background: rgba(8, 47, 73, 0.72);
    color: #ecfeff;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .pipeline {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1.6fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
